  "details": "The events are triggered once (as expected) when testing in ClientSim, but in-game, they are triggered twice.\n\nRepro: \n\n- Create a Button (on a canvas)\n\n- Add an `Event Trigger` component\n\n- Add a Pointer Enter event type\n\n- Hook it up to an udon behaviour\n\n- Observe that the method on the udon behaviour called by the event trigger is called twice when the pointer enters (hovers) the button \n\nThis happens for Pointer Enter and Pointer exit. It likely occurs for all Pointer Events: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/ui-pointer-down-triggering-multiple-times-per-click-in-unity-only",
